{
  "title": "ISic001517. Purchase of a burial lot by Phelix, a doctor",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Valentina Mignosa</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span>Ἀγορασία <br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Φηλίκος\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Φηλίκος\">Φηλίκος</span></span>  <br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>εἰατροῦ ὁλ-<br id=\"al4-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span>οκ(οτίνου) α´ συνμα <br id=\"al5-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>ρτυροῦντος <span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Πέ\n                    τρου\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Πέ\n                    τρου\">Πέ-<br id=\"al6-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span>τρου</span></span> καὶ <span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Μαρκιά\n                    νου\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Μαρκιά\n                    νου\">Μαρκιά-<br id=\"al7-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">7</span>νου</span></span> καὶ <span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Μεθίου\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Μεθίου\">Μεθίου</span></span> 𐆌𐆌𐆌 </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Valentina Mignosa</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span>ΑΓΟΡΑΣΙΑ<br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Φηλίκος\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Φηλίκος\">ΦΗΛΙΚΟΣ</span></span><br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>ΕΙΑΤΡΟΥΟΛ<br id=\"al4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span>ΟΚΑΣΥΝΜΑ<br id=\"al5-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>ΡΤΥΡΟΥΝΤΟΣ<span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Πέ\n                    τρου\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Πέ\n                    τρου\">ΠΕ<br id=\"al6-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span>ΤΡΟΥ</span></span>ΚΑΙ<span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Μαρκιά\n                    νου\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Μαρκιά\n                    νου\">ΜΑΡΚΙΑ<br id=\"al7-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">7</span>ΝΟΥ</span></span>ΚΑΙ<span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Μεθίου\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Μεθίου\">ΜΕΘΙΟΥ</span></span>𐆌𐆌𐆌</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2><a href=\"ISic001517_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo Museo Archeologico Regionale Paolo Orsi\" src=\"ISic001517_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic001517.jpg\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo Museo Archeologico Regionale Paolo Orsi\" src=\"ISic001517-thumb.jpg\"></a></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span>  <span>Text after Agnello 1953, checked against photograph</span>  </span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0003-3819-8537\">Jonathan Prag</a></p>  <p>Purchase of the doctor Phelik (Felix), for one holoktinos (solidus), with Petros, Markiasnos and Methios witnessing.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>For the cost of purchase, cf. IG14.142 (<a href=\"https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic000959\" target=\"_blank\">ISic000959</a>)</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> Orsi 1895 486 no.165 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001711\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001711</a></li><li> Agnello 1953 no.21 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002211\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002211</a></li><li> Manganaro 1988 64, 85 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001427\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001427</a></li><li> Rizzo 1989 63 no.21 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001640\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001640</a>  </li><li> Cassia 2009-2012 170 no.22 </li><li> Lamagna and Amato 2014 22 ph <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001892\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001892</a></li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"><p>Lunate sigma, lunate and quadrate epsilon, broken bar alpha, but also cursive alpha.</p> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence.  </div>",
